{"_id":"blogPost-kosten","_type":"blogPost","slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"kosten"},"order":10,"readMin":6,"meta":{"de":"Notiz · Preisrahmen","en":"Note · price ranges","ru":"Заметка · цены"},"title":{"de":"Was kostet eine Website in Deutschland?","en":"What does a website cost in Germany?","ru":"Сколько стоит сайт в Германии?"},"body":{"de":[{"_type":"block","_key":"k000000","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k000001","text":"Eine Frage, die in vielen Diskussionen auftaucht – und auf die es selten eine einfache Antwort gibt. Diese Notiz fasst grobe Preisrahmen zusammen, wie sie in öffentlichen Quellen und Foren genannt werden. ","marks":[]},{"_type":"span","_key":"k000002","text":"Kein Angebot","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"k000003","text":", einfach ein Lese-Überblick.","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k000004","style":"h3","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k000005","text":"Grobe Preisrahmen, wie sie häufig genannt werden","marks":[]}]},{"_type":"block","_key":"k000006","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k000007","text":"Baukasten (Wix, Jimdo, Squarespace):","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"k000008","text":" ca. 10–30 € pro Monat – Eigenleistung beim Aufbau, eingeschränktes Design.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"k000009","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k00000a","text":"Freelancer / Einzelentwickler:","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"k00000b","text":" häufig 600 – 3.000 € einmalig für kleine Business-Websites.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type":"block","_key":"k00000c","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","_key":"k00000d","text":"Klassische Webagentur:","marks":["strong"]},{"_type":"span","_key":"k00000e","text":" 3.000 – 15.000 € für vergleichbare Projekte – mit mehr Overhead.","marks":[]}],"listItem":"bullet","level":1},{"_type